[0,"o","                                           \u001b[90m│\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m│\u001b[39m It is by design minimalistic and not a production ready agent. It is meant as an educational showcase of the moving  \u001b[90m│\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m│\u001b[39m parts inside a small coding agent: a tool-using loop, a session event stream, and a terminal UI that consumes those  \u001b[90m│\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m│\u001b[39m events without knowing too much about the agent internals.                                                           \u001b[90m│\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m│\u001b[39m                                                                                                                      \u001b[90m│\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m│\u001b[39m The goal for this project is to create something usable, which is a great starting point to learn about agent        \u001b[90m│\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m│\u001b[39m intrinsics.                                                                                                          \u001b[90m│\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m│\u001b[39m                                                                             "]
